  "mastery": {
    "_doc": "Weapon mastery. 'xp' is the total needed for each rank. A run's budget = per_minute x minutes (active time, capped at minutes_cap) x tier scale, plus boss and clear bonuses; it is shared between weapons by the square root of the damage each landed. kills_per_minute is the kill rate below which a run counts as not really fighting. idle_after is how long the player can stand still before the time stops counting. Each weapon's 'mastery' list holds its perks and 'evolutions' its two evolved forms; 'mods' use the weapon's own stat names and may add stats the script reads with a default.",
